{"4413360": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Bigfoot Hunting", "steam_appid": 4413360, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the untamed forests and face one of the greatest legends of the wild. In Bigfoot Hunting, survival depends on your wits, skill, and careful planning. Every shadow could hide danger, and every choice can mean life or death. 🌲</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔫 Dynamic Combat &amp; Hunting</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage Bigfoot with firearms or melee weapons in real-time combat. Plan your attacks carefully, rushing in can be deadly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏕️ Explore &amp; Interact</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search cabins, open doors, and navigate the forest using flashlights or night vision. The world is alive, and every corner could hold supplies or danger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎒 Survival Tools</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use medkits to heal, set traps, bait, and deploy motion sensors to track the creature. Scavenging and planning are key to staying alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎲 Random Events &amp; Loot</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two hunts are the same. Encounter unexpected events, scavenge supplies, and upgrade your gear to improve your chances against the forest’s ultimate predator.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The wild is calling… Bigfoot is near. Will you survive the hunt or become another forgotten story whispered through the trees? 🐾</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the untamed forests and face one of the greatest legends of the wild. In Bigfoot Hunting, survival depends on your wits, skill, and careful planning. Every shadow could hide danger, and every choice can mean life or death. 🌲</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔫 Dynamic Combat &amp; Hunting</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage Bigfoot with firearms or melee weapons in real-time combat. Plan your attacks carefully, rushing in can be deadly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏕️ Explore &amp; Interact</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search cabins, open doors, and navigate the forest using flashlights or night vision. The world is alive, and every corner could hold supplies or danger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎒 Survival Tools</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use medkits to heal, set traps, bait, and deploy motion sensors to track the creature. Scavenging and planning are key to staying alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎲 Random Events &amp; Loot</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two hunts are the same. Encounter unexpected events, scavenge supplies, and upgrade your gear to improve your chances against the forest’s ultimate predator.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The wild is calling… Bigfoot is near. Will you survive the hunt or become another forgotten story whispered through the trees? 🐾</p>", "short_description": "Survive the wilderness in Bigfoot Hunting. Track and hunt the legendary creature using firearms, traps, and survival tools. Explore forests, scavenge supplies, and face random deadly encounters where every step could be your last.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4413360/a9765d877cb5ea5c30ed114674dbb66b008ac853/header.jpg?t=1776689923", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstati